<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners sell 270.98 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thur.</title>
<headline>Foreigners sell 270.98 mln rand SAfrica bonds Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners sold a net 270.98 million rands worth of South African bonds on Thursday after selling 299.09 million on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
